How to start zookeeper and kafka-broker
1. Start Start Zookeeper
> cd kafka_2.13-3.3.1/bin
> ./zookeeper-server-start.sh ../config/zookeeper.properties

2. Start Kafka Broker
> cd kafka_2.13-3.3.1/bin
> ./kafka-server-start.sh ../config/server.properties

How to send string/json message from producer
1. Send the string message to kafka-topic from producer
url: GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kafka/publish?message="helloworld"
2. Consumer will read/consume/subscribe this message from kafka-topic, see the message in Log-Colsole

1. Send the json message to kafka-topic from producer
url: POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kafka/publish
payload: {
            "id": 3,
            "firstName": "Jon",
            "lastName": "Cena"
         }
2. Consumer will read/consume/subscribe this message from kafka-topic, see the message in Log-Colsole
